  {
   "@id": "https://micheldumontier.github.io/bh-meet/people.jsonld#anggi",
   "@type": "Person",
   "name": "Anggi (Angganararas Lungidningtyas)",
   "identifier": "anggi",
   "description": "Bioinformatics lead at BB Binomika, part of BGSI, Indonesia's national whole genome sequencing programme under the Ministry of Health. Recently finished a population-stratified pharmacogenomics analysis of four anti-epileptic drug variants across the full BGSI cohort, and is mapping carrier frequencies for ten ACMG SF actionable gene loci in the same cohort. Also benchmarked MGI against Illumina on 23 dually sequenced samples.",
